<title>JAPAN: Nankai Elec Railway - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Nankai Elec Railway - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 58.62		vs	   59.64</p>
<p> Operating	   10.05		vs	   10.40</p>
<p> Current		3.35		vs	    2.51</p>
<p> Net		    1.48		vs	    1.30</p>
<p> EPS		    3.02 yen	  vs	    2.83 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    501 million	  vs	 461 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  2.50 yen	  vs	    2.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Nankai Electric Railway Co Ltd is a local railway operator with a line to Kansai International Airport.</p>
